SUMMARY: This file defines the Pydantic contract models for project editor API payloads.

It declares literal enums for `Sector`, `Stage`, `CompanyRole`, and editable field names. `KeyDate` has `label` and `date`, forbids extra fields, and rejects blank labels. `EditableFields` has `name`, `sector`, `country`, `stage`, and `key_dates`, forbids extras, and rejects blank `name`/`country`. `ProjectDetail` adds `id`. `ProjectSummary` is the reduced list view. `LinkedCompany` has `name` and `role`.

`StoredProject` accepts extra upstream fields by ignoring them, requires `linked_companies`, and can convert to `ProjectDetail` or `ProjectSummary`. Response/request wrappers include list/detail/save/conflict/uncertain shapes. `SaveRequest` forbids extras.
